sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as __main__.py
    participant CFG as Config/RoutingConfig
    participant ENG as ConversionEngine
    participant MAT as matcher pipeline
    participant MM as ManualMatchesConfig
    participant PIS as PowerIcScorer
    participant CSA as CSAWriter
    participant RTR as WireRouterBase (registry)
    participant TXT as TextLayoutOptimizer
    participant OVL as OverlapDetector
    participant REP as AestheticReport

    Note over CLI,REP: 转换主流程（含 D3 人工匹配 → D5 路由器分发 → D1/D2 美观化）

    CLI->>CFG: --routing detour --manual-matches manual_matches.yaml --aesthetic
    CFG->>CFG: load routing.yaml + CLI 覆盖（mode/text_layout/overlap/power_ic）

    ENG->>ENG: _stage_parse() → DesignIR
    ENG->>ENG: _stage_scan() → ComponentDB（hdl_lib [+ --extra-hdl-lib]）

    Note over ENG,MAT: D3 注入点：自动匹配之后、catalog 重建之前
    ENG->>MAT: _stage_match() → match_results（自动，U* conf=0.4475 ACTIVE_WITHIN_TYPE）
    alt manual_matches 配置存在
        ENG->>MM: ManualMatchesConfig.load(manual_matches.yaml)
        MM-->>ENG: matches[{refdes:U6, library_id:dc_dc, section:1}]
        ENG->>ENG: _apply_manual_matches() 覆盖 MatchResult(strategy=MANUAL, conf=1.0)
        ENG->>ENG: 校验引脚数：不匹配 → warning 入报告，继续转换
    end

    alt power_ic.enabled
        ENG->>PIS: candidates(instance)（引脚数+引脚名+电源网名评分）
        PIS-->>ENG: score ≥ 0.80 → 自动替换 MatchResult（POWER_IC_AUTO）
        Note over PIS: score 0.50-0.80 → 进 export_unmatched candidates
    end

    ENG->>CSA: CSAWriter(router=create_router(mode), text_optimizer, report)
    CSA->>CSA: _compute_pin_geometry() → pin_coords（body + 真实符号 css 偏移）
    CSA->>RTR: route_nets(net_pin_map, body_outlines, design, page)
    alt mode=detour
        RTR->>RTR: LaneRouter 车道法 + _stub_with_detour（正交绕障）
    else mode=edif_reuse
        RTR->>RTR: EDIF 折线映射 + 端点重定到引脚
    else mode=p0 / 异常回退
        RTR->>RTR: LaneRouter 车道法（logger.warning 记录回退）
    end
    RTR-->>CSA: routed_nets（WIRE/DOT 端点 = LASTPIN 坐标，硬约束）

    opt text_layout.enabled
        CSA->>TXT: optimize(page_conn, body_coords, pin_coords, routed_nets)
        TXT->>TXT: collect_text_items() → bbox 估算 → detect_collisions() → resolve()
        TXT->>TXT: align_net_names(x=snap25(trunk_min_x+375)) / align_ports / diff_pair_pn
        TXT-->>CSA: label_offsets（仅标签坐标，LASTPIN/WIRE 不变）
    end

    opt overlap.check
        CSA->>OVL: detect(page, body_coords, _collect_body_outlines())
        OVL-->>REP: overlaps[]
    end

    CSA->>REP: add_text_stats / add_align_stats / add_grid_stats
    CSA->>CSA: 写出 pageN.csa（FORCEADD+LASTPIN → WIRE → DOT）
    REP->>REP: write(output_dir) → aesthetic_report.txt

    ENG-->>CLI: ConversionReport（+ unmatched_report.yaml 若 --export-unmatched）
